From bc9bba0ba19205a5c71e7fe344cf33729543d928 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:14:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] oxalic: port to biosteam 2.54 / thermosteam 0.54.2 / pandas 3

- oxalic/units.py, HP/units.py (imported by oxalic's process specification):
  StirredTankReactor is no longer exported by biosteam.units; BatchBioreactor
  `V` keyword renamed `V_max` (same patch as fi-HP).
- oxalic/process_areas.py: positional Series indexing via .iloc (pandas 3).
- oxalic/models/model_utils.py: Model(metrics=...) renamed `indicators`.
- cellulosic create_facilities: FireWaterTank has no streams in biosteam >= 2.52;
  CoolingTower blowdown is outs[0] (CT-1 is now evaporation) (same patch as
  fi-succinic).
- oxalic sugarcane system: when F301 evaporates nothing, the wastewater is only
  the AceticAcid placeholder and the high-rate WWT polishing filter (U503)
  returns slightly negative water, giving complex RO costs that break
  solve_price; clip negative U503 outlet flows. Guard the TEA-breakdown figure
  (UnitGroup.df_from_groups fails with pandas 3 read-only arrays).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EDo4jhmi7JA1qzTHaSinXa
